      "body": "Found 2026-08-09: the Reports build reconciled its three modelled receipts (₹17,896) to the dashboard's ₹18,100 tile by carrying the ₹204 difference as \"undocumented small cash buys\" — and said so rather than hiding it. Spend with no receipt behind it posts no batch and no movement, so it was money out that bought stock the ledger never received. Fixed the same day by **dropping the plug rather than inventing a receipt to justify it**: there was no evidence the shop made those purchases, and minting an unplanned receipt (§8) would have manufactured a document to protect a number. `SMALL_BUYS` is gone from both files and the tile now sums the receipts themselves — ₹11,436 + ₹1,850 + ₹4,610 = ₹17,896, re-added by hand. The dependent moved with it (+8% → **+7%** against the ₹16,700 baseline) and what should not move did not: gross profit held at ₹4,776 and the cost ratio at 79.0%, because the ₹204 was purchase spend and never cost of goods sold.",
