      "body": "The composer models the gate — every §13 figure still shown, send control disabled **in place** with the reason stated rather than behind a dialog, test-send-to-self explicitly ungated because it needs nobody's consent, and the split labelled modelled-from-spec rather than measured. **Closed 2026-08-09** when the screen was built: the gate released rather than being removed — `consentScreenShipped` flipped from false to true and nothing else in `Admin Promote.dc.html` changed, verified by diffing the whole file against the pre-build copy (one character). The toggle survives, so the blocked state stays inspectable and the gate cannot be quietly dropped when the composer is next touched.",
