      "body": "Automated in `validate_contrast.py` (`check_overrides`), scanned automatically whenever `--doc` is passed, so the loop's existing command covers it with no change. Unit-tested in `test_validate_contrast.py` (declared hex allowed, undeclared reported with path and line, shorthand `#FFF` expanded before comparison, case-insensitive, every offender reported). End-to-end proven 2026-08-08 by planting `#BADBAD` in `pages/admin.md`: flagged at the right line, exit 1; removed, exit 0.",
