      "ask_text": "Hello — I need the real opening hours for the app.\n\nTwo things: what time does the shop open and close, and between what times can we realistically deliver? They may not be the same — I'd guess deliveries stop a bit before the shutters come down.\n\nDo the hours change on Sundays, or for festivals like Wangala?\n\nRight now the app has 7am–9pm for the shop and 8am–8:30pm for delivery, but I made those up as placeholders and I don't want to leave them in. Customers will see these, and the app decides whether to say \"open\" or \"closed\" based on them. Thank you.",
