      "body": "**Gates:** every SMS the platform will ever send — OTP included\n\n**Needs before applying:** PAN, GST certificate\n\nThe other long pole, and the longest single wait in the project.\n\nUnder TRAI's rules every commercial SMS in India passes through DLT. You register the **entity** once, then a **header**, then every **template**. Unregistered templates are not throttled — they are simply not delivered.\n\nNothing sends until this clears, and it gates the sign-in OTP, which means it gates a customer being able to log in at all.\n\n## Where it stands\n\nNot started. Nothing has been submitted.\n\n*Append dated lines here as things happen. Do not rewrite history — a wrong assumption you can see is worth more than a tidy record.*",
